线下方，头部被桌面边缘框住，形成“窥视感”与“被困感”的视觉张力；前景地毯、中景人物、背景办公区层层递进，构建稳定而富有叙事性的空间结构。\n\n视觉引导：通过桌面边缘的水平线与人物视线方向形成交叉引导，观众目光先落于面部表情，再沿手臂线条滑向地面，最终被地毯纹理与腿部曲线吸引，完成由情绪到身体语言的视觉旅程；冷暖对比——白衬衫与灰裙的中性色系与肤色暖调形成微妙平衡。\n\n光影氛围：顶部嵌入式LED灯带提供均匀冷白光，光线自上而下柔和洒落，在衬衫肩部与膝盖处形成高光，阴影过渡细腻；整体氛围冷静、克制、略带孤独感，模拟手机或便携相机在室内自然光下的真实拍摄效果，不追求过度美化，强调“瞬间抓拍”的生活质感与情绪沉淀。\n\n—— 总字数：798 ——", [false, true]], "inputs": [{"name": "text", "link": 88, "label": "文本", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 66, "type": "PreviewTextNode", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PreviewTextNode"}, "order": 18}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "CLIP", "links": [1, 4], "label": "CLIP", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "CLIP"}], "size": [270, 106], "pos": [870.8798217773438, 365.0633544921875], "widgets_values": ["qwen_3_4b.safetensors", "lumina2", "default"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "clip_name"}, "name": "clip_name", "label": "clip_name", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "CLIP名称"}, {"widget": {"name": "type"}, "name": "type", "label": "type", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "类型"}, {"widget": {"name": "device"}, "shape": 7, "name": "device", "label": "device", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "设备"}], "flags": {}, "id": 2, "type": "CLIPLoader", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CLIPLoader"}, "order": 9}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "image", "links": [79], "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image"}, {"name": "mask", "label": "遮罩", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "mask"}, {"name": "original_size", "label": "原始大小", "type": "BOX", "localized_name": "original_size"}, {"name": "width", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "width"}, {"name": "height", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "height"}], "size": [270, 330], "color": "rgba(38, 73, 116, 0.7)", "pos": [-319.8501892089844, 159.0131378173828], "widgets_values": ["original", 1, 1, "letterbox", "lanczos", "8", "shortest", 1080, "#000000"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "image", "